# Copy to .env at the repo root (gitignored). Used by scripts/smoke.ts (`cd scripts; npm run smoke`).
# Project Settings → API in the Supabase dashboard. The service role key bypasses RLS: it never
# goes into the app, a build, or CI logs. Point this at a dedicated smoke/staging project: the
# smoke test leaves a settled group behind (docs/DEPLOY.md, "Smoke test").
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-KEY
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=YOUR-SERVICE-ROLE-KEY

# The app reads its own app/.env (EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY); see app/.env.example.
